<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER - HOSTS UAE BEAT KUWAIT 1-0 IN ASIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - HOSTS UAE BEAT KUWAIT 1-0 IN ASIAN CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hosts the United Arab Emirates</p>
<p>beat Kuwait 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in an Asian Cup semifinal tie on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Hassan Ahmed 69</p>
<p>Attendence: 55,000</p>
</text>
